        f"{num(1.25 * extra['extrapolated_hs_seconds']) if extra.get('extrapolated_hs_seconds') is not None else None} s. "
        f"→ New: {forwards['total']} forwards (D {forwards['d']}, Hillis–Steele rounds {forwards['hillis']}, "
        f"S {forwards['s']}), {num(unit * forwards['total']) if unit is not None else None} s, "
        f"1.25× threshold {num(1.25 * unit * forwards['total']) if unit is not None else None} s. "
        "Reason: each dependent round is ceiled on its own. The saved smoke unit is reused. "
        "The frozen amendment that quotes the old threshold is not edited. The counted runs pass either threshold.",
        "- Resident KV. Old: Π plus one chunk. "
        "→ New: retained Π plus the clone of Π and one chunk, "
        + (", ".join(f"{name} {resident[name]['bytes']} bytes" for name in ("D", "M", "S"))
           if resident else "architecture record missing")
        + ". Reason: the packed forward clones the cache and the original Π stays allocated.",
        "- 4096-digit time. Old: a 2.2 s Blelloch figure. "
        f"→ New: Hillis–Steele model time on the counted 4096-digit records has median "
